## Context
QA task: exercise the audit-log search path and report test gaps. Read-only — no code edits. Exploration done; one premise correction: audit search does **not** live in `SystemAdminService` (it only injects `AuditLogService`). The real path is:

- Repo: `backend/src/main/java/com/nulogic/infrastructure/audit/repository/AuditLogRepository.java` — `searchAuditLogs` (tenant-scoped, lines 41-55), `searchCrossTenant` (lines 138-153), date-range/derived finders.
- Service: `backend/src/main/java/com/nulogic/application/audit/service/AuditLogService.java` — `searchAuditLogs` (l.130), `searchCrossTenant` (l.216), `getAllAuditLogsCrossTenant` (l.~207, both with `requireSuperAdminOrSystemAdmin()`).
- Controllers: `AuditLogController` `GET /api/v1/audit/search` (AUDIT:VIEW); `SystemAuditLogController` `GET /api/v1/admin/system/audit-logs[/search]` (`@PageableDefault(size=50)`, SYSTEM_ADMIN revalidate=true).

## Static findings (already established)
- Filters: entityType, action, actorId, startDate/endDate (ISO), tenantId (cross-tenant only) — all optional, null = match-any.
- Sort: hardcoded `ORDER BY createdAt DESC`; no user sort → no sort-injection surface.
- Envelope: raw Spring `Page<AuditLogResponse>` (no custom wrapper) — consistent across both controllers.
- Invalid params (bad UUID / bad date) → Spring binding 400 via GlobalExceptionHandler; **no startDate>endDate validation** (returns empty silently); empty-string entityType not rejected; tenant-scoped endpoint has no page-size cap.

## Steps (execution phase)
1. Run existing tests (from `backend/`):
   `./mvnw test -Dtest='AuditLogServiceTest,AuditLogControllerTest' -Djacoco.skip=true`
   (Note memory: Testcontainers needs colima docker.sock symlink; these are Mockito/MockMvc tests so should not need Docker — fall back gracefully if env fails.)
2. Capture pass/fail counts and which scenarios the suites actually assert (pagination, per-filter, empty page, security-events 400 guard).
3. Report (≤120 words): test results + gap list.

## Known gaps to report
- `SystemAuditLogController` (cross-tenant search) has **zero tests**; `searchCrossTenant`/`getAllAuditLogsCrossTenant` untested in service too (incl. revalidate=true permission re-check, enrichment).
- No combined-filter test (entityType+action+dates together).
- No invalid-param tests (malformed UUID/date → 400).
- No startDate>endDate validation or test.
- No page-size cap on tenant-scoped endpoint; envelope metadata untested.

