age<AuditLog> findAllByOrderByCreatedAtDesc(Pageable)` | **Cross-tenant** — all tenants (SuperAdmin only) |\n| `searchCrossTenant` | 138-153 | `Page<AuditLog> searchCrossTenant(@Param(\"tenantId\") UUID, @Param(\"entityType\") String, @Param(\"action\") AuditAction, @Param(\"actorId\") UUID, @Param(\"startDate\") LocalDateTime, @Param(\"endDate\") LocalDateTime, Pageable)` | **Cross-tenant search** — tenantId is nullable filter (when null, spans all tenants) |\n\n**Notable design:**\n- `searchCrossTenant` uses `(:tenantId IS NULL OR a.tenantId = :tenantId)` to allow cross-tenant or single-tenant filtering\n- `searchAuditLogs` (tenant-aware) uses `CAST(:startDate AS LocalDateTime) IS NULL` pattern for optional date bounds\n\n---\n\n### 2. SystemAdminService — Audit-Log Search Methods\n\n**File:** `/Users/fayaz.m/IdeaProjects/nulogic/nu-aura/backend/src/main/java/com/nulogic/application/admin/service/SystemAdminService.java`\n\n**Status:** SystemAdminService does **NOT** contain audit-log search methods. Audit search is delegated to `AuditLogService` (injected at line 63).\n\n---\n\n### 3. AuditLogService — Audit-Log Search Methods\n\n**File:** `/Users/fayaz.m/IdeaProjects/nulogic/nu-aura/backend/src/main/java/com/nulogic/application/audit/service/AuditLogService.java`\n\n| Method | Lines | Signature & Details |\n|--------|-------|-------------------|\n| `searchAuditLogs` | 130-140 | `Page<AuditLogResponse> searchAuditLogs(String entityType, AuditAction action, UUID actorId, LocalDateTime startDate, LocalDateTime endDate, Pageable)` — Tenant-aware, extracts tenantId from TenantContext, calls repository.searchAuditLogs with 7 params |\n| `getAllAuditLogsCrossTenant` | ~207-210 | `Page<AuditLogResponse> getAllAuditLogsCrossTenant(Pageable)` — Cross-tenant, calls requireSuperAdminOrSystemAdmin() defense-in-depth, delegates to repository.findAllByOrderByCreatedAtDesc |\n| `searchCrossTenant` | 216-222 | `Page<AuditLogResponse> searchCrossTenant(UUID tenantId, String entit