\n| **Untested enrichment (enrichResponseCrossTenant)** | MEDIUM | Test Coverage | Cross-tenant audit logs need actor name enrichment from EmployeeRepository; no tests verify this with cross-tenant data |\n| **No permission revalidation endpoint test** | HIGH | Security | SystemAuditLogController.searchCrossTenant has @RequiresPermission(revalidate=true) but no test verifies DB re-lookup on each request |\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Covered vs. Uncovered Scenarios\n\n**COVERED:**\n- Tenant-scoped single and multi-filter search\n- Pagination (single page, empty pages)\n- Action logging with metadata\n- Permission annotations on endpoints\n- Security events with revalidate guard\n- Entity/actor/action/entityType filters in isolation\n\n**UNCOVERED:**\n- Cross-tenant search functionality end-to-end\n- Date-range validation\n- Combined filter interactions (e.g., entityType + action + date simultaneously)\n- Response envelope structure (Page metadata)\n- Invalid/boundary param conditions (bad UUID, malformed date)\n- Permission revalidation in practice\n- Empty/null filter edge cases\n- Max page size caps and enforcement"}],"totalDurationMs":105405,"totalTokens":84808,"totalToolUseCount":30,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":98,"cache_read_input_tokens":80316,"output_tokens":4391,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":98},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":4391,"cache_read_input_tokens":80316,"cache_creation_input_tokens":98,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":98,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":14,"searchCount":16,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
